[
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "お疲れ、樹里\r\n今日は特別いいステ－ジだったな！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "bg": "00008",
    "bgm": "006"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001040010,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "……そうか？　別に、いつも通りだろ\r\n良かったとしたら、ユニットのみんなの活躍じゃね－の？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "011",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/101100104/1011001040010",
    "charCategory": "stand_costume"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（いや、他のみんなももちろんすごかったけど\r\n樹里が曲の間奏で見せた、あのダンス……）",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（激しくて、しかもすごく綺麗だった……\r\n今日のために、かなり練習を積んでたもんな）",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001040020,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "……なんだよ\r\n人の顔をじろじろ見やがって……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100104/1011001040020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや……\r\nステ－ジを楽しめたみたいだな、樹里",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001040030,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "……\r\nま－な……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100104/1011001040030"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001040040,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "目の前にお客さんがいて、すげ－声援が聞こえてきて\r\nそれに負けないくらい、声を張り上げて歌って……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100104/1011001040040"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001040050,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "……アンタの言う通りだよ\r\n多分アタシは、楽しかったんだと思う……",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100104/1011001040050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか……\r\nよかったな、樹里",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001040060,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "お、おう……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100104/1011001040060"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001040070,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "なんかすげ－今さらだけどさ……\r\nアンタって、やっぱプロデュ－サ－なんだな",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100104/1011001040070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "な、なんだ急に\r\n出会ったときからそうだっただろ？",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001040080,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "まあ、そう言われればそうなんだけどさ\r\nアタシは最近やっと気付いたっていうか……",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100104/1011001040080"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001040090,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "なあ、プロデュ－サ－からみてどうなんだ？\r\n今のアタシは……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100104/1011001040090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "樹里のことを、どう思っているか？\r\nそれは……",
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "select": "スカウトして\r\n正解だったと思う",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "樹里らしい\r\nアイドルになってきた",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "プロ意識が\r\n身に付いてきてる",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "スカウトして正解だったと思ってる\r\nあの時、樹里と出会えて良かったよ",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001040100,
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "そ、そっか……\r\nまあその……アタシも同じ気持ちだよ",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100104/1011001040100"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001040110,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "けど、そっか……あの時アンタと偶然出会わなきゃ\r\nアタシ、今ごろ全然違うことやってたんだろ－な",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100104/1011001040110"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001040120,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "あれからあんまり時間は経ってね－はずなのに\r\nアタシの生活は一気に変わっちまったよ",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100104/1011001040120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……もしかして、後悔してるのか？",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001040130,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "……さあ、どうだろうな",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100104/1011001040130"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001040140,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "歌やダンスのレッスンはキツいし\r\nアイドルの世界は知らね－ことばっかりだし",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100104/1011001040140"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001040150,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "でも……ユニットの連中と出会えたこととか\r\nさっきのステ－ジのこととか考えると……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100104/1011001040150"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001040160,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "……悪くね－よ。うん……",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100104/1011001040160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか……それなら何よりだ",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001040170,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "あのさ……プロデュ－サ－\r\nアタシに色々教えてくれて……ありがとな",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100104/1011001040170"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001040180,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "い、いやその……ほら！　アタシ、アイドルは\r\n可愛いもんだとか、そのくらいにしか考えてなかったから",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100104/1011001040180"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001040190,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "けど……プロデュ－サ－のお陰で色々知れたよ\r\nアタシのまま、アイドルになっていいんだってわかった",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100104/1011001040190"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001040200,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "アタシ……やっぱりあの時\r\nアンタにスカウトされて、正解だったよ",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100104/1011001040200"
  },
  {
    "charLabel": "juri"
  },
  {
    "text": "★選択肢②【樹里らしいアイドルになってきた】",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "樹里らしいアイドルになってきたって、そう思うよ",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001040210,
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "アタシらしい、アイドルか……",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100104/1011001040210"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001040220,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "はじめて聞いた時にはよくわかんなかったけど\r\n今なら少し、わかる気がするな",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100104/1011001040220"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001040230,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "というかそれよりもっと前……最初声かけられた時なんて\r\n正直さ……アイドル？　なんだよそりゃって思ってたんだ",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100104/1011001040230"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ははは……まあ、はじめは俺が\r\n無理矢理引き入れたようなもんだったからな",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001040240,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "ホントだよ……けど、アンタに誘われて\r\nちょっとワクワクしたのも確かなんだよな",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100104/1011001040240"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001040250,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "あの頃はさ、なんでもいいから新しいことに挑戦したくて\r\n……とにかく、そういう衝動があってさ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100104/1011001040250"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001040260,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "それでアタシ自身よくわかんないまま\r\nなんとなくアイドルを始めたと思ってたんだけど……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100104/1011001040260"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001040270,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "アタシがなんでアイドルの道を選んだのか\r\n今なら少し、わかる気がしてきたよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100104/1011001040270"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "樹里がアイドルになった理由？\r\nそれって……",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001040280,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "……言わね－\r\nあとは自分で考えなよ、プロデュ－サ－",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100104/1011001040280"
  },
  {
    "charLabel": "juri"
  },
  {
    "text": "★選択肢③【プロ意識が身に付いてきてる】",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "プロ意識が身に付いてきてるんじゃないか？",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001040290,
    "label": "3",
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "そ、そう見えるか？\r\nテキト－なこと言ってんじゃね－だろうな？",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100104/1011001040290"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "言ってないよ\r\n樹里は間違いなく、アイドルらしくなってきてるよ",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001040300,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "そ、そっか\r\nふぅ……それなら良かったよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100104/1011001040300"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001040310,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "実際、最初のころは衣装を着るだけでも\r\n恥ずかしかったんだけど、今はちょっと慣れたかもな",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100104/1011001040310"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "確かに、前より堂々と着こなすようになったよな\r\n……うん、よく似合ってるよ",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001040320,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "なっ……あんまりじろじろ見るんじゃねぇよ！",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100104/1011001040320"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なんだ、ファンの前ではあんなに堂々としてるのに",
    "charLipAnim": "blank",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001040330,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "それとこれとは、話が違うだろ！\r\nファンのために頑張るのは、アイドルとして当然で……",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100104/1011001040330"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ファンのため、か\r\n本当に、すっかりアイドルらしくなったよな",
    "charLipAnim": "blank",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001040340,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "はぁ？　別にこのくらい、前から……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100104/1011001040340"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001040350,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "いや、違うか……前はファンのこと\r\nほとんど意識なんてしてなかったよな……",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100104/1011001040350"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うん。やっぱり樹里は\r\n立派に成長しているんだよ",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001040360,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "そ、そうかよ……",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100104/1011001040360"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001040370,
    "speaker": "樹里",
